AutoName: Shake Flashlight
Summary: Shake-motion activated flashlight
Description: |
    A simple open-source flashlight app made to mimic the shake behaviour of Motorola smartphones for other Android devices.

    Features:
    * Flashlight toggle
    * Motion activation
    * Activation controls (Shake counts, resets and time between shakes)
    * Minimal permissions
    * No ads
    * No tracking

RepoType: git
SourceCode: https://gitlab.com/0-n0n3/shakelight.git

Builds:
  - versionName: 1.0.0
    versionCode: 1
    commit: v1.0.0
    subdir: app
    gradle:
      - yes

